From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AIOS Project <aios@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Export framework MMS sources to AIOS Messaging

AIOS Messaging is a platform-signed SMS role candidate and needs the same
maintained PDU codec and Telephony provider persister already shared with
Bluetooth. Export the existing framework-mms-shared-srcs filegroup without
changing framework runtime behavior or copying the protocol implementation into
vendor code.
---
 telephony/common/Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/telephony/common/Android.bp b/telephony/common/Android.bp
index b0a812bf..3ab86b38 100644
--- a/telephony/common/Android.bp
+++ b/telephony/common/Android.bp
@@ -27,1 +27,2 @@
+        "//vendor/aios/apps/messaging",
     ],
